### ===== BUG 1 - @Cacheable stale data (run instances on 8080 and 8081) =====

### reset price to 999
POST http://localhost:8080/bug1/reset

### read on 8081 - caches 999 there
GET http://localhost:8081/bug1/broken/price/1

### update to 499 on 8080 (evicts 8080's cache only)
PUT http://localhost:8080/bug1/broken/price/1?value=499

### 8080 - 499
GET http://localhost:8080/bug1/broken/price/1

### 8081 - still 999 (STALE)
GET http://localhost:8081/bug1/broken/price/1

### --- fixed (shared Redis cache - start Memurai or Redis first) ---
GET http://localhost:8081/bug1/fixed/price/1

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/bug1/fixed/price/1?value=499

### 8081 - 499
GET http://localhost:8081/bug1/fixed/price/1


