### ===== BUG 3 - @Transactional self-invocation =====

### broken - payment fails, order stays
POST http://localhost:8080/bug3/broken/orders

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/bug3/orders

### fixed - payment fails, order rolled back
POST http://localhost:8080/bug3/fixed/orders


### ===== BUG 4 - LazyInitializationException =====

### seed - note the orderId
POST http://localhost:8080/bug4/seed

### controller path - works thanks to open-in-view
GET http://localhost:8080/bug4/controller/1

### async path - LazyInitializationException
GET http://localhost:8080/bug4/async/broken/1

### async path, fixed with @EntityGraph
GET http://localhost:8080/bug4/async/fixed/1


